WEBVTT

00:00:00.103 --> 00:00:05.651
These are the key habits from Module 12 Treat
important views as

00:00:05.677 --> 00:00:11.385
contracts Separate stable reusable meaning from
report-specific

00:00:11.398 --> 00:00:17.834
logic Understand whether a view is writable Be

00:00:17.847 --> 00:00:24.707
precise about the difference between limiting an
interface and enforcing authorization Remember

00:00:24.733 --> 00:00:30.940
that materialized views create a freshness
obligation And inspect dependencies

00:00:30.966 --> 00:00:32.677
before changing shared objects
